              Contains exactly 1 Cyber Signet Ring, 1 Heavy Chain + Pendant, and 1 Chain Bracelet. Crafted with 316L stainless steel chains and bracelets.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex items-baseline gap-3">
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#F5F5F7]">₹1,199</span>
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-[#A3A7AE]">Save ₹248 against ₹1,447 bought separately.</span>
