            </a>
            <a href="/collections/all" class="inline-flex h-14 items-center justify-center border border-[#C8CDD3] bg-transparent px-6 font-mono-tech text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#F5F5F7] transition-all hover:bg-white/5 rounded-none">
